  "title": "LinearKV and QV-PIC: Hybrid-PIC Frameworks for Efficient LLM and RAG Serving",
  "summary": "LinearKV introduces a training-free hybrid-PIC framework that allows for position-independent caching in hybrid LLMs, improving efficiency and performance. QV-PIC addresses the representation-specific challenges of visual position-independent caching, improving retrieval and generation efficiency while maintaining text quality.",
